Client -> API: DELETE the folder
note right of API
  The system USER_FOLDER_BINDING This route doesn 't remove.
  The projection: active USER_STREAM_BINDING + It 's canonical . STREAM.is_archived = false.
  All chats = All of them .; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false.
end note
API -> DB: BEGIN; block the folder in the specified region
API -> DB: Remove the binding/elements + FOLDER Through the life cycle FK
API -> OUT: I 'm going to add folder.deleted
